A rectangular yard contains two flower beds in the shape of congruent right triangles. The remainder of the yard is a rectangular lawn, as shown. The dimensions of the lawn are $40$ feet by $60$ feet, and the legs of each triangle measure $10$ feet. What is the area of the lawn?

[asy]
