\dfrac{31!}{28!3!} &= \dfrac{31\times30\times29\times28!}{28!\times3\times2\times1} \\
&= \dfrac{31\times30\times29}{3\times2\times1} \\
&= 31\times5\times29 \\
&= \boxed{4485}.
\end{align*} The answer is 4485.</span>
