&= r^2(r + 9) + r^2 + 18 \\
&= rs + 9r + 7 + r + 18 \\
&= 8r + 25 \\
&= 8(r + s) + 25 \\
&= 8(-5) + 25 \\
&= \boxed{-15}.
\end{align*}The answer is: -15
